# Mesh Hop (P2, the shell): the header with the Esc button, the tab row (Chats, Contacts, Settings), the caption line and the
# Quit question are the launcher's widgets and follow the screen; the page bodies are still a 640 px column (the stage)
# centred under them. At the five sizes, no board (the app offline). Taps go by label, a tap beside the stage does nothing,
# the keys come through the shared keyboard bridge. No shot or layout check here: the shared size rules (rows 7 mm, buttons
# 9 mm) fail on every control of the page bodies until the pages are converted (P3, P4); mesh-hop-script `check`
# (tests/flows/shell.script) holds the shell, which is outside the stage, to them.
title Mesh Hop: the shell at five sizes
env MESHHOP_DATA /tmp/mesh-hop-scene-data
env MESHHOP_PORT /nonexistent/ttyMH
env MESHHOP_ONLINE 0
sizes 640x480 800x480 720x720 1024x600 1280x720

wait 900
expect text "Chats"
expect text "Contacts"
expect text "Settings"
expect text "Esc"
expect notext "Map"
expect notext "Terminal"
expect noquit

# the Contacts tab by its label
tap "Contacts"
expect text "Zero-hop"

# beside the stage (the letterbox): nothing happens
@800x480 tapxy 0.03 0.5
@720x720 tapxy 0.5 0.9
@1024x600 tapxy 0.05 0.5
@1280x720 tapxy 0.05 0.5
expect text "Zero-hop"

# the Settings tab, then a row of its list opens the packet log (a sub-page that covers the tab row); the header Esc goes back
tap "Settings"
expect text "Node name"
tap "Packet log"
expect text "Clear"
tap "Esc"
wait 400
expect notext "Clear"
expect text "Node name"

# the keys through cp0_lvgl's queue and the app's key bridge: Tab walks the tabs that are shown (Settings -> Chats -> Contacts)
key tab
key tab
expect text "Zero-hop"
# a short Esc of the keyboard at the root never quits: it says how to leave (in the caption line)
key esc
expect text "Hold Esc 3 s to exit"
expect noquit

# the header's Esc at the root asks first: Cancel stays, Quit leaves (a touch-only board has no other way out)
tap "Esc"
wait 600
expect text "Quit Mesh Hop?"
expect noquit
tap "Cancel"
wait 400
expect notext "Quit Mesh Hop?"
expect noquit
tap "Esc"
wait 600
expect text "Quit Mesh Hop?"
tap "Quit"
wait 400
expect quit
